{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/Header_JoinACozy90sForum.png?t=1750286303\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/050625_cozyforum.gif?t=1750286303\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the TinyTreeTalk\u1390net forum, customize your profile, and volunteer to help members with their bonsai requests. Restore old bonsai trees, build new dioramas, and put your own twist on the requests. Receive heartwarming comments, gifts, and recognition as you hand them in. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/Header_GrowAndShapeBonsaiTree.png?t=1750286303\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/050625_growing.gif?t=1750286303\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a selection of procedural bonsai trees and make them your own by growing, cutting, and twisting branches to create your perfect little bonsai. Grow your collection and unlock new trees as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/Header_DesignStunningDioramas.png?t=1750286303\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/050625_diorama.gif?t=1750286303\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tell a story and build beautiful scenes using a wide range of props \u2013 everything from stones and lanterns to retro tech, tree houses, and cozy clutter. Unlock and collect new props and pots to express your creativity in countless ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/Header_CaptureAndShareYourArt.png?t=1750286303\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/050625_photomode.gif?t=1750286303\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take beautiful photos. Set up the picture perfect scene by changing the time of day and weather. Customize the camera settings or choose from a selection of presets. Share your photos and dioramas with your friends and the community through Steam Workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/Header_ChillRetroVibes.png?t=1750286303\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/050625_chillretrovibes24.gif?t=1750286303\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in immaculate vibes and unwind to chill lofi beats and '90s retro aesthetics. Customize your music, soundscape, room, and surrounding environment. Decorate your tree with cozy lanterns as you see the rain drip down and the trams run by outside your window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/Header_Idle_FocusMode.png?t=1750286303\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/050625_idlemode.gif?t=1750286303\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lean back and relax with a distraction free environment and a beautiful diorama in the background. Use the Pomodoro timer, to-do list, or other productivity tools to focus and get work done.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3403560?t=1750286303","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/8ce805d46926966d36bbc9a744bc5aa0d64a4932/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750286303","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/2b0b63a82b7a12f42229e384883510b2b4ef2014/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750286303","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/2b0b63a82b7a12f42229e384883510b2b4ef2014/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750286303","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/Header_JoinACozy90sForum.png?t=1750286303\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/050625_cozyforum.gif?t=1750286303\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the TinyTreeTalk\u1390net forum, customize your profile, and volunteer to help members with their bonsai requests. Restore old bonsai trees, build new dioramas, and put your own twi